{"book":"2kings","num":3,"verses":[{"en":"Now Jehoram the son of Ahab began to reign over Israel in Samaria the eighteenth year of Jehoshaphat king of Judah, and reigned twelve years.","n":1,"sm":"Iosefatu le tupu o Iuta na fai ai Ioramo le atalii o Aapo ma tupu O Isaraelu i Samaria. E sefulu ma le lua tausaga na fai ai o ia ma tupu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Iosefatu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Iuta"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioramo"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aapo"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Samaria."},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"sefulu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"lua"},{"en":"","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu."}]},{"en":"And he wrought evil in the sight of the LORD; but not like his father, and like his mother: for he put away the image of Baal that his father had made.","n":2,"sm":"Ua ia faia foi le amio leaga i luma o le ALII, a e lei ausia le amio a lona tama ma lona tina, aua na ia ave ese le tupua o Paala na faia e lona tama.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"luma"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lei"},{"en":"","sm":"ausia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"tama"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"tina,"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ave"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tup